#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:5
msgid "ModelClaim"
msgstr "ModelClaim"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:9
msgid "ModelClaim is experimental. Read `Limitations`_ before you rely on it."
msgstr "ModelClaim 是实验性功能。使用前请先阅读 `限制`_。"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:11
msgid ""
"ModelClaim serves several models from the same GPUs. You deploy a warm "
"pool, which is a Deployment of GPU Pods that run the AIBrix runtime "
"agent, and create one ModelClaim for each model. The controller starts "
"each model as its own engine process, on a Pod whose GPU has room for it."
" The AIBrix gateway then routes requests to that engine by model name. A "
"pool can also put idle models to sleep, which frees GPU memory for the "
"models in use, and the next request for a sleeping model wakes it."
msgstr ""
"ModelClaim 让多个模型共用同一组 GPU。你先部署一个热池，即由运行 AIBrix "
"runtime agent 的 GPU Pod 组成的 Deployment，再为每个模型创建一个 "
"ModelClaim。控制器把每个模型作为独立的引擎进程，启动在 GPU 有空间的 Pod "
"上，AIBrix 网关再按模型名把请求路由到该引擎。热池还可以让空闲的模型休眠，"
"把显存腾给正在使用的模型，对休眠模型的下一个请求会唤醒它。"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:19
msgid ""
"ModelClaim suits models that are busy only part of the time and would "
"otherwise each need a GPU of their own."
msgstr "ModelClaim 适合只在部分时间繁忙、否则各自都要独占一块 GPU 的模型。"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:23
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:38
msgid ""
"A **warm pool** is a Deployment whose Pods run the ModelClaim runtime "
"image and request a fixed number of GPUs. In each Pod, the runtime agent "
"starts, stops, sleeps and wakes engine processes for the controller."
msgstr ""
"**热池** 是一个 Deployment，其 Pod 运行 ModelClaim 的 runtime 镜像，"
"并申请固定数量的 GPU。在每个 Pod 中，runtime agent 替控制器启动、停止、"
"休眠和唤醒引擎进程。"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:41
msgid ""
"A **ModelClaim** names a model and the pool it runs in. It also sets the "
"engine arguments, and declares how much GPU memory one instance needs."
msgstr ""
"**ModelClaim** 指定一个模型及其所在的热池，还设置引擎参数，"
"并声明一个实例需要多少显存。"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:43
msgid ""
"The **ModelClaim controller** places each claim on a Pod whose GPU has "
"room for it, and has the runtime agent start the engine there. The "
"engines on a GPU share its memory for their KV caches through kvcached, "
"and the controller gives each engine a KV cache limit. Once an engine is "
"ready, the controller writes its port in an annotation on the Pod, which "
"this guide calls the engine's route."
msgstr ""
"**ModelClaim 控制器** 把每个 claim 放置到 GPU 有空间的 Pod 上，并让 "
"runtime agent 在那里启动引擎。同一块 GPU 上的引擎通过 kvcached 共用这块 "
"GPU 的显存来存放各自的 KV cache，控制器为每个引擎设定 KV cache 上限。"
"引擎就绪后，控制器把它的端口写进 Pod 上的一个注解，"
"本指南称之为该引擎的路由（route）。"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:49
msgid ""
"The **AIBrix gateway** reads the routes and sends each request to the "
"engine of its model. When the model is asleep, the gateway asks the "
"controller to wake it and tells the client to retry."
msgstr ""
"**AIBrix 网关** 读取这些路由，把每个请求发给对应模型的引擎。"
"如果模型在休眠，网关会请控制器唤醒它，并让客户端重试。"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:54
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "限制"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:56
msgid ""
"**One engine per claim.** ``replicas`` must be 1, so a claim runs one "
"engine on one Pod."
msgstr ""
"**每个 claim 一个引擎。** ``replicas`` 必须为 1，因此一个 claim 只在一个 "
"Pod 上运行一个引擎。"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:58
msgid ""
"**Tested setups.** ModelClaim has been tested with vLLM on NVIDIA H20 "
"GPUs, with tensor parallelism 1 and 2 in one Pod. Pipeline parallelism, "
"tensor parallelism above 2, Pods with more than two GPUs and other GPU "
"types have not been tested. Data parallelism is not supported."
msgstr ""
"**已测试的环境。** ModelClaim 已在 NVIDIA H20 GPU 上配合 vLLM 测试过，"
"覆盖单个 Pod 内张量并行度为 1 和 2 的情况。流水线并行、张量并行度大于 2、"
"每个 Pod 超过两块 GPU 以及其他型号的 GPU 都未经测试。不支持数据并行。"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:62
msgid ""
"**One GPU layout per pool.** A vLLM claim must use all the GPUs of its "
"Pod, so models with different parallelism go in separate pools."
msgstr ""
"**每个热池只有一种 GPU 布局。** vLLM 的 claim 必须用满所在 Pod 的全部 "
"GPU，因此并行方式不同的模型要放在不同的热池里。"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:64
msgid ""
"**Host memory is not managed.** ModelClaim puts engines to sleep with "
"vLLM's sleep level 1, which moves a model's weights from the GPU to host "
"memory until the engine wakes. The controller does not count host memory "
"when it places claims or puts engines to sleep. If many models sleep on "
"one node, the node can run out of memory, and engines can be killed. Size"
" the pool's memory request for all its models asleep at once."
msgstr ""
"**主机内存不受管理。** ModelClaim 用 vLLM 的 sleep level 1 让引擎休眠，"
"它会把模型权重从 GPU 移到主机内存，直到引擎被唤醒。控制器在放置 claim "
"和让引擎休眠时都不计算主机内存。如果一个节点上有很多模型同时休眠，"
"节点可能耗尽内存，引擎可能因此被杀掉。"
"请按热池中所有模型同时休眠的情况设置其内存请求。"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:70
msgid ""
"**Sleep and wake are per pool, and on request.** Only vLLM engines sleep."
" The sleep policy applies to every model in a pool, so a model that must "
"stay awake needs a pool without idle sleep. A sleeping model wakes only "
"when a request for it reaches the AIBrix gateway, which answers that "
"request with 503 instead of holding it, so clients must retry."
msgstr ""
"**休眠与唤醒按热池设置，且只在有请求时唤醒。** 只有 vLLM 引擎会休眠。"
"休眠策略作用于热池中的每个模型，"
"因此必须保持唤醒的模型需要放在不启用空闲休眠的热池里。"
"休眠的模型只有在发给它的请求到达 AIBrix 网关时才会被唤醒。"
"网关会对这个请求返回 503，而不是挂起等待，因此客户端必须重试。"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:75
msgid ""
"**Declared GPU memory.** The controller trusts the figures that a claim "
"declares in ``perGPU``, and does not measure a model's footprint. "
"kvcached limits only the KV cache, so an engine that needs more than its "
"declared footprint can run the GPU out of memory."
msgstr ""
"**显存按声明计算。** 控制器信任 claim 在 ``perGPU`` 中声明的数值，"
"不会测量模型的占用。kvcached 只限制 KV cache，"
"因此实际需要超过所声明占用的引擎可能耗尽 GPU 显存。"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:79
msgid ""
"**No live migration.** A claim moves to another Pod when its engine fails"
" permanently or cannot wake where it is. A new engine then loads the "
"model there, and the model serves nothing until that engine is ready."
msgstr ""
"**不支持热迁移。** 当 claim 的引擎永久失败，或无法在原地唤醒时，claim "
"会迁移到另一个 Pod。新的引擎会在那里重新加载模型，在它就绪之前，"
"该模型不提供服务。"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:82
msgid ""
"**Runtime image.** The published runtime image contains vLLM and is built"
" for ``linux/amd64`` only. It is published from ``main`` and is not part "
"of AIBrix releases. ``engine: sglang`` needs your own image with SGLang "
"and kvcached, and has not been tested."
msgstr ""
"**runtime 镜像。** 发布的 runtime 镜像只包含 vLLM，并且只构建了 "
"``linux/amd64`` 版本。它从 ``main`` 发布，不属于 AIBrix 的正式版本。"
"``engine: sglang`` 需要你自己构建包含 SGLang 和 kvcached 的镜像，"
"且未经测试。"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:86
msgid ""
"**Model sources.** Only Hugging Face artifacts (``huggingface://``) have "
"been tested."
msgstr "**模型来源。** 只测试过 Hugging Face 的模型（``huggingface://``）。"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:88
msgid ""
"**Claim names.** A claim's name can be at most 63 characters, because it "
"is part of annotation keys on the Pod."
msgstr ""
"**claim 名称。** claim 的名称最多 63 个字符，因为它是 Pod "
"上注解键的一部分。"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:90
msgid ""
"**No access control.** The runtime agent's API on port 8080 has no "
"authentication, and the engines accept vLLM's own sleep and wake calls on"
" their ports, from 20000 to 20999. Anything that can reach a pool Pod can"
" start, stop, sleep or wake its engines. Limit access to these ports, for"
" example with a NetworkPolicy that admits only the ModelClaim controller,"
" Envoy and Prometheus."
msgstr ""
"**没有访问控制。** runtime agent 在 8080 端口上的 API 没有认证，"
"引擎也会在自己的端口（20000 到 20999）上接受 vLLM 自带的休眠和唤醒调用。"
"任何能访问到热池 Pod 的程序，都能启动、停止、休眠或唤醒其中的引擎。"
"请限制对这些端口的访问，例如用 NetworkPolicy 只允许 ModelClaim 控制器、"
"Envoy 和 Prometheus 访问。"

