msgstr ""
"AIBrix 控制面。其标准安装已包含 ModelClaim 的 CRD 和控制器，"
"以及网关对它的支持。参见 "
":doc:`../getting_started/installation/installation`。"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:105
msgid ""
"Access from the GPU nodes to Docker Hub for the runtime image, and to "
"wherever your models are stored."
msgstr ""
"GPU 节点能访问 Docker Hub 以拉取 runtime 镜像，也能访问存放模型的位置。"

