msgid ""
"Use the claim's ``modelName``, such as ``qwen3-0.6b``, rather than the "
"claim's name, ``qwen3-0-6b``."
msgstr ""
"请使用 claim 的 ``modelName``，例如 ``qwen3-0.6b``，而不是 claim 的名称 "
"``qwen3-0-6b``。"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:721
msgid "Requests get 503 with ``error on getting pods``"
msgstr "请求得到 503，提示 ``error on getting pods``"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:722
msgid ""
"The model is on the route, but its Pod is not Ready. The gateway sends "
"requests only to Ready Pods."
msgstr "模型已在路由中，但其 Pod 未就绪。网关只把请求发给就绪的 Pod。"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:725
msgid "A claim stays ``Pending``"
msgstr "claim 一直处于 ``Pending``"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:726
msgid "Read its ``Scheduled`` condition:"
msgstr "查看其 ``Scheduled`` 条件："

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:732
msgid ""
"``no available candidate warm pod`` means that no Pod qualifies. Check "
"that the Pod has both labels, is running, and has as many GPUs as the "
"claim needs. A message about GPU memory names the Pod that came closest "
"and what it lacks. For ``InvalidPerGPU`` or ``TooLargeForAnyCard``, "
"correct ``perGPU``."
msgstr ""
"``no available candidate warm pod`` 表示没有符合条件的 Pod。请检查 Pod "
"是否带有这两个标签、是否在运行，以及其 GPU 数量是否与 claim 所需相同。"
"关于显存的消息会指出最接近的 Pod 以及它还差什么。如果是 ``InvalidPerGPU`` "
"或 ``TooLargeForAnyCard``，请修改 ``perGPU``。"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:738
msgid "A claim reads ``Failed`` with ``InvalidEngineConfig``"
msgstr "claim 处于 ``Failed``，原因为 ``InvalidEngineConfig``"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:739
msgid ""
"Remove ``--gpu-memory-utilization``, and check the parallel sizes. Engine"
" arguments cannot be changed, so delete the claim and create it again."
msgstr ""
"去掉 ``--gpu-memory-utilization``，并检查各并行度。引擎参数不能修改，"
"因此请删除 claim 后重新创建。"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:742
msgid "A claim stays ``Activating``"
msgstr "claim 一直处于 ``Activating``"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:743
msgid ""
"The engine may still be downloading or loading its model. Check the "
"runtime agent's log, and the engine's ``last_error`` in the runtime "
"snapshot:"
msgstr ""
"引擎可能仍在下载或加载模型。请查看 runtime agent 的日志，以及 runtime "
"snapshot 中该引擎的 ``last_error``："

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:751
msgid "A Pod is turned away because an engine there \"answers to no claim\""
msgstr "Pod 因其上的引擎 “answers to no claim” 而被拒绝"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:752
msgid ""
"The controller cannot tell what such an engine holds on the GPU, so it "
"places nothing on that Pod. Stop the engine through the runtime agent's "
"API, or restart the Pod:"
msgstr ""
"控制器无法知道这样的引擎在 GPU 上占用了多少，因此不会在该 Pod 上放置任何 "
"claim。请通过 runtime agent 的 API 停止该引擎，或重启该 Pod："

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:761
msgid "Engines are gone after the runtime agent restarted"
msgstr "runtime agent 重启后引擎都不见了"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:762
msgid ""
"Check that the Pod runs the runtime image as published, which restarts "
"the agent inside the container, and that it mounts ``/var/run/aibrix``."
msgstr ""
"请检查 Pod 是否使用原样发布的 runtime 镜像（它会在容器内重启 agent），"
"以及是否挂载了 ``/var/run/aibrix``。"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:766
msgid "Validation"
msgstr "验证"

#: ../../source/features/modelclaim.rst:768
msgid ""
"To check ModelClaim on your own GPUs, follow the `validation runbook "
"<https://github.com/vllm-"
"project/aibrix/blob/main/development/tutorials/modelclaim/manual-"
"validation-runbook.md>`_. It runs these samples and covers placement and "
"GPU memory division, sleep and wake, recovery from engine faults, and "
"deletion."
msgstr ""
"要在你自己的 GPU 上检查 ModelClaim，请按照 `验证手册 "
"<https://github.com/vllm-project/aibrix/blob/main/development/tutorials/modelclaim/manual-validation-runbook.md>`_ "
"操作。它会运行这些示例，覆盖放置与显存划分、休眠与唤醒、"
"引擎故障恢复以及删除。"

